Item.ВыполнениеКода_ПодсказкаКонтекстКлиентаРасширеннаяПодсказка.Title=The code &<b>OnClient</> is initially executed, from which it is already possible to call the <b>&OnServerRun </><b>RunServerCode(ServerText, AdvancedOptions) method;</>\n\n<b><colorstyle -3>Available variables\:</></>\n<colorstyle -3> </><u><colorstyle -3>CurrentShape</></><colorstyle -3> </><colorstyle -3>- selected open form;</>\n<colorstyle -3> </><u><colorstyle -3>ServerText</></<b>><colorstyle -3> </></><colorstyle -3>- code text running on the server</>\n<colorstyle -3> </><u><colorstyle -3>AdvancedOptions</></><b><colorstyle -3> </></><colorstyle -3>- a framework for communication between client and server</>\n\n<b><colorstyle -3>Available methods\:</></>\n<colorstyle -3> </<u>><colorstyle -3>ExecuteServerCode(ServerText, AdvancedOptions);</></>\n\n
Item.ВыполнениеКода_ПодсказкаКонтекстСервераРасширеннаяПодсказка.Title=The code runs in the context of the server, but has no way to access the form. It is necessary to get values, for example, from queries.\n\n<b>Available variables\:</>\n<u>Advanced</> Parameters - A Framework for Client-Server Data Exchange
