Item.Команда_ПроверитьНаличиеРеквизитаРасширеннаяПодсказка.Title=Checks the presence of requisites in the form, for the subsequent possibility of interactive editing.\n\nSince the platform does not have the ability to get a list of details of another open form, this tool has a mechanism for searching for details. Not all details can be detected automatically, however, you can check the presence manually.\n\nIt is also possible to specify a list of requisite names in the tool settings, the presence of which will be automatically checked in each open form.
