Item.ОткрытыеФормыПараметрыРасширеннаяПодсказка.Title=Form options that are available after you open the form
Item.ОткрытыеФормыРеквизитыРасширеннаяПодсказка.Title=Contains a tree of details of the selected form.\n\nYou can change the values of the requisites and tables of the form.\n\nDue to platform limitations, it is not possible to get a list of details of another open form. This tool implements "scanning" of the form using built-in templates. You can check the presence of details that could not be determined manually by entering the name of the attribute in the field at the bottom of the table.\n\nIt is also possible to specify a list of requisite names in the tool settings, the presence of which will be automatically checked in each open form.
Item.ОткрытыеФормыСвойстваРасширеннаяПодсказка.Title=A list of form properties with the ability to set values.\n\nThrough the corresponding item in the context menu (or by pressing F5), the list is updated\nThe list of properties includes <u>AutoTitle</>, <u>Accessibility</>, <u>Title</>, <u>Modified</>, <u>ViewOnly</>\n\nIt is possible to set the value of any arbitrary form property in the "<u>Custom Setting</>" item
Item.ОткрытыеФормыУникальныйИдентификаторРасширеннаяПодсказка.Title=Unique shape identifier. All processing methods operate with it in determining the form.
