Item.ОткрытыеФормыЭлементыПоложениеЗаголовка.Title=Position
Item.ОткрытыеФормыЭлементыРасширеннаяПодсказка.Title=Contains the element tree of the selected shape.\n\nYou can change the properties\: <u>Visibility</>, <u>ViewOnly</>, <u>Availability</>.\n\nWhen you double-click on an element, the selected form is activated with positioning on the selected element.\n\nThrough the corresponding item in the context menu (or by pressing F5), the tree is updated\n\n
